-Reflect $(2,3)$ across the line $y=x$. With $u=(1/\sqrt{2},1/\sqrt{2})$:
+例子：
+反映 $(2,3)$ 越线 $y=x$。和 $u=(1/\sqrt{2},1/\sqrt{2})$:
 
 $$
 R = \begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0 \end{bmatrix}.
 $$
 
